            <ArticleTitle>Technique Tip: Modification of DuVries's lesser metatarsophalangeal joint arthroplasty to improve joint mobility.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>278-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An interposition arthroplasty for the treatment of pain and stiffness in the second metatarsophalangeal joint (MTPJ) is presented. The procedure is a modification of DuVries's lesser MTPJ arthroplasty and is specifically intended to improve limited dorsiflexion not addressed by the original procedure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
